Sat Nov 07 18:00:00 UTC 2026 - ahjolinna <ahjolinna@yahoo.com>

- Make nano the default EDITOR, in environment.d for the desktop and in
  profile.d for TTY and SSH logins. An EDITOR set by the user is kept.
- Let the person at the machine mount internal disks without the
  administrator password, and let an administrator at the machine
  change the time zone and automatic time without it. From KDE Linux.
- Install KeepSecret from Flathub with the other applications.
