Tue Oct 27 21:00:00 UTC 2026 - ahjolinna <ahjolinna@yahoo.com>

- Create /var/log/tuned before relabeling it. tuned-ppd was denied
  creating tuned-ppd.log because the directory was still var_log_t.
  Relabel again before the daemon starts.
- Welcome Center stays on the download page until the Flatpak seed
  has actually finished. An unchecked systemd condition is not
  "already installed".

-------------------------------------------------------------------
Tue Oct 27 18:00:00 UTC 2026 - ahjolinna <ahjolinna@yahoo.com>

- Hide the systemd-boot menu after a normal shutdown, and show it for
  7 seconds after a crash. Hold Space to open it. The timeout is the
  EFI variable. loader.conf is not rewritten, and sdbootutil is not
  called, because timeout 0 there means menu-disabled.
- Stop seeding Ark. The pattern installs the Ark RPM so Dolphin can
  use the system service menus.

-------------------------------------------------------------------
Tue Oct 27 16:00:00 UTC 2026 - ahjolinna <ahjolinna@yahoo.com>

- New accounts use the AtropOS global theme, org.atropos.desktop, and
  the brightness control treats that theme as dark.
- Welcome Center shows a download animation while the Flatpaks install.
- powertop is /usr/sbin/powertop. The unit was calling /usr/bin/powertop.
- Relabel /var/log/tuned so tuned-ppd can create its log.
- Hide the encrypted system disk from Dolphin. Removable disks stay.
  The shell argument is written as $$ so udev does not eat $1.
- Discover's About page says RPM. Kirigami's formcard module prefers
  its built-in page, so the package bind-mounts a copy without that line.

